<h1>A private cycle tracker</h1>
<p class="lede">Sanguine helps you track and understand your menstrual cycle. It is not a contraceptive and is not a medical device.</p>
<p class="lede">Everything you log stays on your phone, encrypted. There is no account and no server, so we cannot see your data and cannot hand it to anyone.</p>

