<h2>What it does</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Log your period, flow, symptoms, temperature, ovulation tests and cervical mucus in two taps.</li>
  <li>See your next period and your ovulation as ranges, with a plain-language confidence grade, never as a single promised day.</li>
  <li>Understand your history: cycle length, period length and how they vary.</li>
  <li>Import your history from Natural Cycles or a CSV, and export everything whenever you like.</li>
  <li>Optional two-way sync with Apple Health and Health Connect, one data type at a time.</li>
  <li>Optional encrypted backup to your own iCloud Drive or Google Drive. The file is encrypted on your phone before it leaves.</li>
  <li>App lock, discreet notifications, a discreet app icon and name, and screenshot protection.</li>
  <li>No analytics, no advertising, no tracking. Free, with nothing locked away.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Get Sanguine</h2>
<p>Coming soon to the App Store and Google Play, in Australia first.</p>

<h2>Open source</h2>
<p>Sanguine is free software under the AGPL. Read the code, check the claims above against it, or build it yourself: <a href="https://github.com/Amnesthesia/sanguine">github.com/Amnesthesia/sanguine</a>.</p>

<p class="note">Sanguine does not diagnose, screen for or treat any condition. If you are worried about your health, talk to a health professional.</p>
</Base>
